WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:03.082
- My name's Ashley and today
I am going to test out some

00:00:03.082 --> 00:00:06.551
of the most pinned Halloween
costumes from Pinterest.

00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:08.960
Every year Pinterest rounds
up their most viral pins

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.312
of the Halloween season.

00:00:10.312 --> 00:00:12.331
I picked three of those viral costumes.

00:00:12.331 --> 00:00:14.238
I'm gonna see if they're
actually cute, or funny,

00:00:14.238 --> 00:00:16.458
or any of the things
that Halloween costumes

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:17.514
are supposed to be.

00:00:17.514 --> 00:00:19.751
Out of all three of these
one of them better work

00:00:19.751 --> 00:00:21.823
cause I need a Halloween
costume by next week.

00:00:21.823 --> 00:00:24.098
The first costume that
I'm going to make today

00:00:24.098 --> 00:00:25.656
is a jellyfish costume.

00:00:25.656 --> 00:00:28.703
I did not know that jellyfish
were so trendy right now,

00:00:28.703 --> 00:00:30.913
but apparently they are because not only

00:00:30.913 --> 00:00:33.082
is this particular pin very popular,

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:34.932
but as I looked into it there are like

00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:36.357
a thousand other versions,

00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:38.531
which I find very interesting.

00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:41.174
The first thing that I'm
gonna do is sew these scarves

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.999
onto the elastic band of the tutu.

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:46.316
Her scarves were
definitely cooler than mine

00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:48.522
but I could not find those anywhere.

00:00:48.522 --> 00:00:51.109
The thought of having to do
individual little stitches

00:00:51.109 --> 00:00:53.060
to attach these lights to this tutu,

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.777
kinda makes me wanna die.

00:00:54.777 --> 00:00:57.004
So instead, I'm gonna try hot gluing it.

00:00:57.004 --> 00:00:58.694
Oh, I think this will work.

00:00:58.694 --> 00:01:01.860
I'm trying not to glue it
in a straight line, around.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.671
I'm trying to make it a little
more constellation-esque.

00:01:04.671 --> 00:01:06.946
I think I accidentally
glued this to the table.

00:01:06.946 --> 00:01:08.544
(grunting)

00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:09.813
Oh no.

00:01:09.813 --> 00:01:12.244
The last step is to put on some pearls.

00:01:12.244 --> 00:01:13.573
Ooh this is not easy.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.417
I think I'm gonna have
to call in for back up

00:01:15.417 --> 00:01:18.560
and by back up I mean hot glue.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.467
That's cute!

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.618
I don't know if it looks like
a jellyfish but it's cute.

00:01:21.618 --> 00:01:24.177
I think this costume needs
a little bit of context.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:25.987
Like maybe it could be a group costume

00:01:25.987 --> 00:01:27.669
and you're all little sea creatures.

00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:28.981
It takes a little explaining to do,

00:01:28.981 --> 00:01:30.012
but you know what?

00:01:30.012 --> 00:01:31.352
That's just a conversation starter.

00:01:31.352 --> 00:01:33.814
It's like, no I'm not a nimbus
cloud thank you for asking.

00:01:33.814 --> 00:01:35.487
I am a jellyfish.

00:01:35.487 --> 00:01:37.545
I'd say this is for sure pin-able.

00:01:37.545 --> 00:01:40.694
This next costume is
a little more complex.

00:01:40.694 --> 00:01:43.718
It is a jetpack that's looks
like it's supposed to actually

00:01:43.718 --> 00:01:45.110
be lifting off the ground.

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:47.171
The first thing I'm
gonna do is take a bunch

00:01:47.171 --> 00:01:50.062
of colored felt and
cut out pieces of fire.

00:01:50.062 --> 00:01:52.174
I have many flames here and now

00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:55.541
I'm basically gonna hot
glue them onto these pants,

00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:58.653
and make myself some fiery legs.

00:01:58.653 --> 00:02:00.609
So this could either go fiery jetpack

00:02:00.609 --> 00:02:02.971
or very festive chicken.

00:02:02.971 --> 00:02:05.839
The blog that has
inspired this costume said

00:02:05.839 --> 00:02:08.327
to use cement molding tubes.

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:10.588
I could not find that
in Manhattan anywhere,

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:14.623
so instead I got these hamster play tubes,

00:02:14.623 --> 00:02:15.710
they're like meant for your hamster

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.253
to run through and chew up,

00:02:17.253 --> 00:02:21.493
but we're gonna use
them to make a jetpack.

00:02:21.493 --> 00:02:24.076
(upbeat music)

00:02:33.961 --> 00:02:35.418
This costume requires not one,

00:02:35.418 --> 00:02:37.144
but two pairs of pants.

00:02:37.144 --> 00:02:38.470
With the second pair,

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.992
I'm going to basically
fill them with newspapers

00:02:40.992 --> 00:02:42.913
so we can have like fake legs.

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:44.699
And then I'm going to glue a light,

00:02:44.699 --> 00:02:47.129
cheap pair of shoes to the ankles.

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:49.480
This has Ashley written all over it.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.980
This is hilarious.

00:02:52.254 --> 00:02:54.145
Like, come on.

00:02:54.145 --> 00:02:55.492
I think this thing is gonna fall apart

00:02:55.492 --> 00:02:57.254
in probably four minutes,

00:02:57.254 --> 00:02:59.322
but for the five minutes I did wear it,

00:02:59.322 --> 00:03:01.309
this is pretty amazing.

00:03:01.309 --> 00:03:02.630
I wish I had a few more flames.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.204
It's a little patchy.

00:03:04.204 --> 00:03:06.938
For the record I got 20
sheets of each color felt,

00:03:06.938 --> 00:03:08.764
so I had 40 sheets of felt all together.

00:03:08.764 --> 00:03:10.938
You know, is it a sexy
Halloween costume? No.

00:03:10.938 --> 00:03:12.699
Is it an epic Halloween costume?

00:03:12.699 --> 00:03:13.533
Hell yeah.

00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:16.485
Our last costume is not an
actually a full costume outfit,

00:03:16.485 --> 00:03:17.832
It's a makeup look.

00:03:17.832 --> 00:03:19.174
Basically what she's doing

00:03:19.174 --> 00:03:22.567
is putting these dark shades
where you would contour

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:25.070
and the light shades
where you would highlight.

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.568
I know a lot of you
that watch this channel

00:03:26.568 --> 00:03:28.076
are very good at makeup.

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:29.411
I am not.

00:03:29.411 --> 00:03:32.328
So, bare with me as I
try and figure this out.

00:03:32.328 --> 00:03:35.260
Now I'm going in with one
that's just a hair lighter

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:38.224
and I'm doing those basically staggered

00:03:38.224 --> 00:03:41.008
on top of my first round.

00:03:41.008 --> 00:03:42.644
Now I'm gonna do the lighter shades

00:03:42.644 --> 00:03:45.469
where I would typically highlight.

00:03:45.469 --> 00:03:47.273
So I've kinda got the contour,

00:03:47.273 --> 00:03:48.436
I've got the highlight,

00:03:48.436 --> 00:03:49.653
and now I'm going to blend.

00:03:49.653 --> 00:03:50.486
(record scratches)

00:03:50.486 --> 00:03:51.884
Not blend, I'm not gonna use
a blending brush on this.

00:03:51.884 --> 00:03:52.717
Absolutely not.

00:03:52.717 --> 00:03:54.315
That would defeat the
entire purpose of this.

00:03:54.315 --> 00:03:57.449
But, we are gonna blend by
just putting a medium shade,

00:03:57.449 --> 00:04:00.192
in between the dark and the light.

00:04:00.192 --> 00:04:01.427
They're a little messy,

00:04:01.427 --> 00:04:02.909
and it's not really
bothering me that much.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:05.314
I think all together it sort
of gives the same effect.

00:04:05.314 --> 00:04:08.466
But, it is hard to try to
make them all the same size.

00:04:08.466 --> 00:04:09.679
(sighs)

00:04:09.679 --> 00:04:10.718
Oh no.

00:04:10.718 --> 00:04:12.522
I am going to move on to the eyebrows now.

00:04:12.522 --> 00:04:14.811
I just got a drugstore eyebrow pencil

00:04:14.811 --> 00:04:17.355
and I'm gonna just make little boxes,

00:04:17.355 --> 00:04:18.942
going up and then one going down,

00:04:18.942 --> 00:04:20.695
one going up and then one going down.

00:04:20.695 --> 00:04:22.601
Before I was like, "Ooh,
I'm gonna look cute."

00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:24.080
Now I'm like, "I look a little crazy."

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.624
But it's still looking cool.

00:04:25.624 --> 00:04:28.221
Sort of like eyeliner where
you just keep working it

00:04:28.221 --> 00:04:30.384
and it just gets worse the
more time you put into it.

00:04:30.384 --> 00:04:32.372
So we're gonna step away from the eyebrow

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.574
and move on to the lip.

00:04:33.574 --> 00:04:37.459
Big mistake I made was using
lip gloss instead of lipstick.

00:04:37.459 --> 00:04:39.918
I just figured the gloss
would be easier to paint on,

00:04:39.918 --> 00:04:42.536
but duh, I should have
just used liquid lipstick.

00:04:42.536 --> 00:04:44.656
So, that is something I
would do different next time.

00:04:44.656 --> 00:04:46.567
But otherwise, I wouldn't
change anything about this.

00:04:46.567 --> 00:04:48.447
I think it came out really cool.

00:04:48.447 --> 00:04:52.204
I would say that this costume
is definitely pin-able.

00:04:52.204 --> 00:04:54.250
I had a really good time
making all of these.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.400
I think they're all
pin-able in their own ways.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.065
Sure mine weren't Pinterest perfect,

00:04:58.065 --> 00:05:00.628
but nothing really is.

00:05:00.628 --> 00:05:03.211
(upbeat music)

